introduction to this Project:
  this project aimed to implement universal,portable,concise RPC protocol through qemu-ivshmem-plain,zero-copied as much as possible

goal of this project:
  implement OpenGL 3D accelaration of WinXP/OldUnix,with GLX/WGL/EGL extension
  clipboard sharing

